								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Checkmate the king. Or paint your way to victory.</h2><br>SHOGITOON is a competitive board game that <strong>combines shogi—Japanese chess—with a colorful battle for territory.</strong><br><br>Move your pieces and paint the squares they threaten in your color.<br>Your goal is to checkmate your opponent’s king—but that’s not the only way to win.<br><strong>Once all 81 squares are painted, the player whose color covers more of the board wins!</strong><h2 class="bb_tag" >Capture a piece. Protect your king. Change the color of the game.</h2><br>A battle for checkmate can suddenly become a race for territory.<br>Falling behind in paint coverage? A checkmate can still turn the game around.<br>Discover a new path to victory in a familiar game of strategy.<h2 class="bb_tag" >Meet 20 opponents, each with a personality of their own.</h2><br><strong>Humans, cats, and foxes are ready to challenge you!</strong><br>Each CPU opponent brings a different approach to attack and defense.<br>Start with a beginner-friendly opponent, or challenge whichever character catches your eye. Play at your own pace.<br><br>Beat a character to earn a <strong>completion mark</strong>, and keep track of your results against each opponent.<br><strong>Collect seven achievements and take on the challenge of defeating all 20 characters.</strong><h2 class="bb_tag" >Play solo or challenge a friend.</h2><br>Face the CPU, enjoy <strong>local matches on the same device, or play online.</strong><br>Japanese-inspired visuals and lively paint effects bring every match to life.<br><br><strong>What will your next move paint?</strong><br><br><i>Please note: In-game text is available in Japanese only.</i>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Generative AI was used to assist with programming and to create visual and audio assets.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
