								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet connection required for online multiplayer. Keyboard/mouse or controller supported.</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
